{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Hey Gina, hope you're doing ok! Still following my passion for dance. It's been bumpy, but I'm determined to make it work. I'm still searching for a place to open my dance studio."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-30/session_3-f0a2589dc9b055a240aad538", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:02:27.901379+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f0a2589dc9b055a240aad538", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f0a2589dc9b055a240aad538", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Hi Jon! So happy you're pushing forward with dancing! Inspiring \ud83d\udcaa I emailed some wholesalers and one replied and said yes today! I'm over the moon because now I can expand my clothing store and get closer to my customers. Check it out - here's a pic!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-30/session_3-299e4b3a109493f0ed601846", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:02:32.006666+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "299e4b3a109493f0ed601846", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "299e4b3a109493f0ed601846", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Wow, Gina! You found the perfect spot for your store. Way to go, hard work's paying off!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-30/session_3-a1a34383430493fad3a7c573", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:02:36.156436+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a1a34383430493fad3a7c573", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a1a34383430493fad3a7c573", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Thanks! Glad you like it. Yeah, it's a great spot. Here's a peek at the space I designed. Cozy and inviting - perfect for customers to check out all the trendy pieces."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-30/session_3-45b2d106c1e2866ca83ec02d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:02:40.303385+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "45b2d106c1e2866ca83ec02d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "45b2d106c1e2866ca83ec02d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Wow, it looks great! Must've taken you ages to design it. What made you pick out the furniture and decor?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-30/session_3-4d9e08cf6936ff9569ad7eb9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:02:44.440381+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4d9e08cf6936ff9569ad7eb9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4d9e08cf6936ff9569ad7eb9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Thanks! It took a bit of time but I wanted to make the place look like my own style and make my customers feel cozy. I chose furniture that looks great and is comfy too. The chandelier adds a nice glam feel while matching the style of the store."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-30/session_3-3a8568f4974515fc3957694d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:02:48.569621+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3a8568f4974515fc3957694d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3a8568f4974515fc3957694d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Your store looks great - your customers will be so comfy."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-30/session_3-12d126113364addb39c64f1c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:02:52.677152+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "12d126113364addb39c64f1c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "12d126113364addb39c64f1c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Thanks! Making my spot comfortable and inviting for my customers is key. I want 'em to feel like they're in a cool oasis. Just creating an experience that'll make 'em wanna come back."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-30/session_3-3b2654adf1dc965221f87c71", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:02:56.813486+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3b2654adf1dc965221f87c71", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3b2654adf1dc965221f87c71", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: That's a great goal! Creating a special experience for customers is the key to making them feel welcome and coming back. I think you can create that space you're imagining."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-30/session_3-4a5313f4f9a3102909a91dcc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:03:00.944439+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4a5313f4f9a3102909a91dcc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4a5313f4f9a3102909a91dcc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Thanks. Your support means a lot. I'm sure with my hard work and effort, I can make a special shopping experience for my customers. It's tough but I'm up for the challenge!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-30/session_3-d95ed0ed00331cdba97bd3da", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:03:05.083656+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d95ed0ed00331cdba97bd3da", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d95ed0ed00331cdba97bd3da", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: I'm always here to support you! Go create something awesome with your store. Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-30/session_3-ccfb30d1036ce8d3fa067d69", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:03:09.209315+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ccfb30d1036ce8d3fa067d69", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ccfb30d1036ce8d3fa067d69", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Thanks, Jon! I'll try my best. You're gonna do great with your dance studio, just keep going and stay positive! We'll get through this!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-30/session_3-ff5cb56c74ce33909f9f568c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:03:13.351060+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ff5cb56c74ce33909f9f568c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ff5cb56c74ce33909f9f568c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! Your words mean a lot. I'm staying positive and pushing forward. We've put our hearts into our dreams and I'm sure we'll make it."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-30/session_3-a94b39069c434af097a75274", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:03:17.488163+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a94b39069c434af097a75274", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a94b39069c434af097a75274", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Sure thing, Jon! Stay motivated and keep going. Hard work pays off eventually. We can do this!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-30/session_3-0acbdd7444042b44df9a77df", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:03:21.626311+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0acbdd7444042b44df9a77df", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0acbdd7444042b44df9a77df", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
